CHAPTER.VERS:
And he said unto him, Say now unto her, Behold, thou hast been careful for us with all this care;
Thus the servants of God are not unthankful for the benefits they receive. what [is] to be done for thee? wouldest thou be spoken for to the king, or to the captain of the host? And she answered, I
I am content with what God has sent me, and can lack nothing that one can do for another. dwell among mine own people.
